6. Accessibility (A11y) Requirements
Keyboard Navigation (Homepage): The Where , Check-in , Check-out , Who fields, and the Search
CTA must be focusable in a logical, sequential order using the Tab key.
Keyboard Navigation (Results Page): The Filters and Map controls must be keyboard-accessible
and clearly display a visible focus indicator state when navigated to.
7. UX & Copy Guidelines
Input Field Labels: Where , Check-in , Check-out , Who
Call to Action (CTA): Search
Language: English-IN (en-IN) standard localization for all above labels.
